			        CALCULATE (
			            [Value],
			            REMOVEFILTERS ( DimGeography ),
			            DimGeography[GeographyCode] = "CA",
			            REMOVEFILTERS ( DimDate ),
			            DimDate[Date] = _date
			        )
			    )
			```
